        {
            "title": "油價升約1%  全周跌半成",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">油價向上，一周計累跌5%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/OIL-PRICE_FB_source-ap_.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/OIL-PRICE_FB_source-ap_.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紐約期油報83.16美元，漲1.03%，布蘭特期油報92.69美元，漲0.80%，一度因油輪觸雷上漲逾1%，結算時回吐。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國際能源署表示油市已轉為過剩，高盛警告2027年可能出現每日200萬桶供給過剩；霍爾木茲海峽10月出口量創戰時新高的每日1140萬桶。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">油價本周走勢與地緣衝突方向相反。伊朗襲擊美國在巴林的雷達設施，霍爾木茲海峽油輪遭縱火，美國打擊格什姆島的革命衛隊導彈基地，但紐約期油全周仍跌約5%，跌破85美元，為8月以來首次。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17230787-%e6%b2%b9%e5%83%b9%e5%8d%87%e7%b4%841-%e5%85%a8%e5%91%a8%e8%b7%8c%e5%8d%8a%e6%88%90",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/01/Oil.png.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-21 11:19:41",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美元指數結束8連升 美國10年期債息失守5厘",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美元指數轉跌，結束連續8日升勢，低見103.57，跌幅約0.4%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"資料圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20240410_source-licensed_USD_FB.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20240410_source-licensed_USD_FB.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">資料圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國國債孳息全線下滑，10年期債息跌穿5厘，低見4.9059厘，跌約15個基點；30年期債息低見5.291厘，兩年期債息低見4.606厘，三者均創逾1星期新低。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">匯市方面，澳元兌美元較早時跌約0.6%，報0.6617；新西蘭元兌美元跌至0.5468。美元兌日圓跌0.7%，報158.55；歐元兌美元報1.0966，英鎊兌美元貼近1.308。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17229687-%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e7%b5%90%e6%9d%9f8%e9%80%a3%e5%8d%87-%e7%be%8e%e5%9c%8b10%e5%b9%b4%e6%9c%9f%e5%82%b5%e6%81%af%e5%a4%b1%e5%ae%885%e5%8e%98",
